      "lineNbr": 54,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-08T20:16:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Inconsistent Argument Ordering** The parameters for Vendor ID (VID) and Product ID (PID) are swapped inconsistently across the API:\n\n* `ft_sg_open(uint16_t vendor_id, uint16_t product_id)` (VID first)  \n* `mbedtls_usb_init(const uint32_t pid, const uint32_t vid)` (PID first)  \n* `mbedtls_usb_connect(const uint32_t pid, const uint32_t vid)` (PID first)  \n* **Recommendation:** Standardize the argument order to `(vid, pid)` throughout the codebase to prevent accidental swapping. Also, consistently use `uint16_t` for VID/PID instead of mixing `uint32_t` and `uint16_t`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 54,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "fcd9064294552a3cbf330ce87121caabb6c418c8",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
