      "writtenOn": "2026-05-08T20:09:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "* **Inconsistent libusb Contexts:** The codebase mixes isolated contexts and the default context. `ft_sg_io.c` initializes an explicit context (`ctx`), `net_usb.c` uses another (`usb_ctx-\u003ectx`), and `ft_usb_port.c` passes `NULL` (`libusb_init(NULL)`), relying on the default context.  \n    \n* *Suggestion:* Unify libusb initialization to share a single application-wide `libusb_context*` to prevent duplicate device polling, resource leaks, and hotplug callback conflicts.",
