      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Missing Null Terminator**\n\nIf the USB device responds with exactly `FT_BOOT_VERSION_MAX` (36) bytes of data without a null terminator, the `%s` format specifier here will read past the end of `databuffer` and cause a buffer overflow (reading garbage memory or crashing).\n\n**Remediation:** Explicitly null-terminate the buffer before logging it:\n```c\ndatabuffer[FT_BOOT_VERSION_MAX - 1] \u003d \u0027\\0\u0027;\nFF_LOGI(\"get boot vesion:%s\", databuffer);\n```",
